flowchart TD
    A[Input data/cleaned on Kaggle] --> B[Build dataframe: image_path, label, width, height, channel, file_size]
    B --> C[Dataset statistics and sample visualization]
    C --> D[Stratified split 70/15/15]
    D --> E[Resize images to 224x224]
    E --> F[Normalize pixels to 0-1]
    F --> G[Apply augmentation only on train set]
    G --> H[Train MobileNet from scratch]
    G --> I[Train ResNet from scratch]
    H --> J[Save MobileNet best checkpoint]
    I --> K[Save ResNet best checkpoint]
    J --> L[Evaluate MobileNet on test set]
    K --> M[Evaluate ResNet on test set]
    L --> N[Accuracy, Precision, Recall, F1-score]
    M --> N
    N --> O[Confusion matrix and classification report]
    O --> P[Visualize correct and wrong predictions]
    P --> Q[Save final artifacts]

